# maintain-rules.md — Rule Template Definition

## Optional Rules

- [required] Versioning: SemVer increment & sync
- [required] Doc sync discipline: changes sync structure.md / requirement docs
- [required] Change flow: summarize → item-by-item confirm → write
- [optional] Regression gate: when regression.md runs
- [optional] Archive & exclude: raw materials archiving; internal dir exclusion
- [optional] Token compression policy: scope & trigger

## Rule Content

- Maintenance rule items (version/sync/change/archive)
- Each item: trigger → behavior (short item)

## Rule Expression

- Short itemized sentences, verb-first
- No rule numbering
- No decision info or references
